              剧本 / 创意
            </span>
            <textarea
              class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:bg-input/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:bg-input/30 dark:disabled:bg-input/80 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 flex field-sizing-content min-h-16 w-full border px-2.5 py-2 transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-3 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:ring-3 md:text-sm border-border bg-subtle text-ink-fainter placeholder:text-ink-faintest resize-none rounded-lg text-[12px] leading-relaxed"
              data-slot="textarea"
              placeholder="支持一句话自动分镜…"
              rows="3"
            >
              清晨，老咖啡馆里，一位老人正在擦拭相框。阳光斜照进来，他想起年轻时的约定。门外，一个熟悉的身影出现……
            </textarea>
          </label>
          <label
            class="block"
          >
            <span
              class="text-ink-faint mb-1.5 block text-[11px]"
            >
              视频工作流（工作流库）
            </span>
            <select
              class="border-border bg-subtle text-ink-field h-9 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 text-[13px] outline-none focus:border-violet-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-violet-500/20"
            >
              <option
                value=""
              >
                工作流库里还没有视频工作流
              </option>
            </select>
            <span
              class="text-ink-fainter mt-1 block text-[10.5px]"
            >
              没有内置视频工作流可回落 —— 请先在工作室「工作流库」导入并配好对外参数。
            </span>
          </label>
          <label
            class="block"
          >
            <span
              class="text-ink-faint mb-1.5 block text-[11px]"
            >
              首帧合成工作流（可选，工作流库）
            </span>
            <select
              class="border-border bg-subtle text-ink-field h-9 w-full rounded-lg border px-3 text-[13px] outline-none focus:border-violet-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-violet-500/20"
            >
              <option
                value=""
              >
                工作流库里还没有图类工作流
              </option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label
            class="border-border bg-canvas/60 flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between rounded-lg border px-3 py-2.5"
          >
            <span
              class="text-ink-field text-sm"
            >
              烧录字幕
            </span>
            <input
              checked=""
              class="accent-violet-500"
              type="checkbox"
            />
          </label>
          <div>
            <span
              class="text-ink-faint mb-1.5 block text-[11px]"
            >
              背景音乐（可选）
            </span>
            <input
              accept="audio/*"
              class="text-ink-fainter w-full text-[11px] file:mr-2 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:bg-violet-500/20 file:px-3 file:py-1.5 file:text-[11px] file:text-violet-800 dark:text-violet-300 dark:file:text-violet-300"
              type="file"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <footer
      class="border-border-subtle bg-panel-deep/95 z-base relative flex h-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t backdrop-blur-sm"
    >
      <span
        class="inline-block h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-sm shadow-emerald-400/40"
      />
      <span
        class="text-ink-muted text-[11px]"
      >
        ComfyUI 本地已连接 · Wan I2V 视频模型就绪 · GPU 可用
      </span>
    </footer>
  </div>
  <div
    class="z-toast pointer-events-none fixed right-5 bottom-8 flex w-[340px] flex-col gap-2.5"
  />
</div>
`;
